WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.782
This query reads the patient-admission summary view
Consumers do not

00:00:05.795 --> 00:00:11.767
need to repeat the join or stay-duration expression
The view already defines

00:00:11.793 --> 00:00:18.418
that interface Run it and identify the grain One

00:00:18.445 --> 00:00:23.142
row represents one admission with selected patient
attributes and a derived stay duration
